 **Data Structures:**
-*   **3D Feature Grid:** An explicit 3D voxel grid storing high-level feature vectors instead of implicit density/color values at coordinates. Let the grid dimensions be $D_x \times D_y \times D_z$. Each voxel stores a feature vector $\mathbf{f} \in \mathbb{R}^C$.
